                                                "sense_id": "0164208e-8fb1-393f-84bb-f1bf8297664d",
                                                "text": "His mother provided some relevant background information concerning his medical condition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4444f40-d0d5-4041-8b9d-dbbed0e8b91c",
                                                "sense_id": "0164208e-8fb1-393f-84bb-f1bf8297664d",
                                                "text": "Although autistic women with AN have cited concerns with weight/shape as less relevant in the development of their ED (Kinnaird, Norton, Stewart, et al., 2019), these could still have been a contributing factor."
